    "blurb": "Integrate Camunda processes with IBM queues",
    "overview": "Allow Camunda-based business processes to send messages to and receive messages from IBM MQ queues as part of a service task, enabling asynchronous communication and decoupling of processes.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Streamline queues with Camunda and IBM MQ",
    "splashDescription": "The Camunda IBM MQ outbound connector seamlessly integrates Camunda process orchestration and automation with IBM MQ by enabling Camunda-based business processes to send messages to and receive messages from IBM MQ queues as part of a service task, enabling asynchronous communication and decoupling of processes. Developers can easily configure queue manager details, host, port, channel, queue name, and message content directly within their BPMN process models.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/699355/overview/img9872674088965227003.png?8604de828ac426c7fc478e5d3b3fce52",
